<title>AUSTRIA: Iran minister arrives for OPEC, happy with oil pri.</title>
<headline>Iran minister arrives for OPEC, happy with oil pri.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iranian oil minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh arrived here on Monday for Wednesday's full OPEC meeting.</p>
<p>He told waiting reporters that he was happy with current oil prices but added that it was too early to comment on any other issues.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2024</p>
</text>
